Both the Ubuntu and Windows VMs were scanned. The -sS scan was captured in Wireshark using the filter tcp.flags.syn==1 && tcp.flags.ack==0. This burst of SYN packets followed by RST packets is the pattern that Snort will detect in Week 3.
